   <media:thumbnail url="https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/CkxaazVPWPo/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>In this episode of RBI Talks: Paisa to Policy, we explore the RBI’s Priority Sector Lending (PSL) framework and how it helps ensure that credit reaches sectors that are vital to the economy and livelihood of communities.

Learn how PSL supports access to timely and adequate credit for sectors such as agriculture, micro, small and medium enterprises, education, housing, and other identified priority segments, while promoting inclusive and balanced economic growth.

Discover how RBI’s Priority Sector Lending framework helps strengthen access to formal credit and supports a more inclusive, resilient, and customer-centric financial ecosystem.

